#: ../../source/docs/pixhawk-force-px4io-flash.rst:5
#: cef21b286d8e464c8b47dd3dca98849d
msgid "Forcing a flash of the IOMCU processor"
msgstr "强制刷写 IOMCU 处理器"

#: ../../source/docs/pixhawk-force-px4io-flash.rst:8
#: 5356aab7e39142ba98c5cc07d5af59b0
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/pixhawk-force-px4io-flash.rst:10
#: 53ec85326be142079cac04e266f4dbf2
msgid ""
"When flashing a new firmware to autopilots with an IOMCU processor, an "
"updated firmware is often flashed to the IOMCU."
msgstr "在向具有 IOMCU 处理器的自动驾驶仪刷写新固件时，通常也会向 IOMCU 刷写更新的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/pixhawk-force-px4io-flash.rst:13
#: 29c6f00630974997b745fdbcbf0134c7
msgid ""
"On occasion this flashing fails, and the board will either endlessly play "
"the first part of the `updating IO firmware tone "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pixhawk_sound_files/PX4_CompletedIOBoardFirmwareUpload.wav>`__,"
" or will play the `failed-to-flash tone "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pixhawk_sound_files/PX4_ReadyToUploadIOBoardFirmware.wav>`__."
"  It may also boot and inform you via a text message to your GCS that the "
"update has failed."
msgstr ""
"有时刷写会失败，飞控板将无限循环播放 `更新 IO 固件提示音 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pixhawk_sound_files/PX4_CompletedIOBoardFirmwareUpload.wav>`__"
" 的前半段，或播放 `刷写失败提示音 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pixhawk_sound_files/PX4_ReadyToUploadIOBoardFirmware.wav>`__。它也可能会启动，并通过文本消息向您的地面站报告更新失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/pixhawk-force-px4io-flash.rst:15
#: 445fc2626ae147ada0148b855582a64f
msgid "The flash can sometimes be forced to completion."
msgstr "有时可以强制完成刷写。"

#: ../../source/docs/pixhawk-force-px4io-flash.rst:19
#: 5a5b383dfc8549168d26b331be8c3529
msgid "Hold safety switch during boot"
msgstr "启动时按住安全开关"

#: ../../source/docs/pixhawk-force-px4io-flash.rst:21
#: befc0bb15f624f0aa2f4bb9840e6eeb8
msgid ""
"Press and hold the safety switch while powering on the autopilot.  You "
"should hear the `updating IO firmware sound "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pixhawk_sound_files/PX4_CompletedIOBoardFirmwareUpload.wav>`__"
" then boot should proceed."
msgstr ""
"在给自动驾驶仪上电时按住安全开关。您应该听到 `更新 IO 固件提示音 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pixhawk_sound_files/PX4_CompletedIOBoardFirmwareUpload.wav>`__，然后启动应正常进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/pixhawk-force-px4io-flash.rst:25
#: 6c53ca506da04d97b45fb67714081eb4
msgid ""
"On px4v1 you should disconnect the telemetry radio before attempting an "
"update the IO firmware"
msgstr "在 px4v1 上，尝试更新 IO 固件之前应先断开遥测无线电。"
